{#- Advance Scene: what a scene description override is, and how it is written (creator.advance-scene) -#}
The scene description override for {{ target_name }} is the scene as known to and experienced by {{ target_name }}. It is used in place of the scene description in the prompts written for {{ target_name }}.

It should be written as a present-tense overview of the setting and situation as far as {{ target_name }} knows it, not as a recap of recent events or a play-by-play of the dialogue.
